          "text": "You will learn"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360047999812-How-to-host-a-custom-font-on-your-site#h_01HK862SFXDD7KKGWFXBQH4ZN6",
          "text": "Using your website’s font"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360047999812-How-to-host-a-custom-font-on-your-site#h_01HK862SFX17BCDV26Z6FQV6CB",
          "text": "Uploading a self-hosted font"
